{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "rabbitmq-observability",
    "name": "MOVE - RabbitMQ Observabilidad y Demo",
    "description": "Consultas a la API de management de RabbitMQ (:15672) para observar la topologia, la profundidad de las colas de trabajo y el contenido de las DLQ. Tambien incluye los endpoints de metricas y health de aplicacion de los 4 servicios.\n\nApoya R4 (metricas) y la demo de R5/R7:\n- Mostrar que gps.detection absorbe la rafaga (profundidad de cola).\n- Mostrar reintentos y mensajes parqueados en las DLQ.\n- Inspeccionar el outbox (via reservation-service) y la recuperacion ante caidas.\n- Mostrar requests por endpoint, pedidos por categoria, alertas por tipo y el estado de las dependencias (Postgres/Redis/RabbitMQ/Ollama) por servicio.\n\nAuth: basic move/move_secret para RabbitMQ (coincide con docker-compose); los endpoints de metricas/health de los servicios no requieren autenticacion.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "rabbitmq_mgmt_url", "value": "http://localhost:15672" },
    { "key": "rabbitmq_user", "value": "move" },
    { "key": "rabbitmq_password", "value": "move_secret" },
    { "key": "api_gateway_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "reservations_url", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "transportations_url", "value": "http://localhost:3002" },
    { "key": "categorizer_url", "value": "http://localhost:3003" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      { "key": "username", "value": "{{rabbitmq_user}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "password", "value": "{{rabbitmq_password}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Overview del broker",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('reporta totales de mensajes', () => pm.expect(body.queue_totals).to.be.an('object'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/overview",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "overview"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar colas con profundidad",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('data is array', () => pm.expect(body).to.be.an('array'));",
              "body.forEach(q => console.log(`${q.name}: listos=${q.messages_ready} sin_ack=${q.messages_unacknowledged}`));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F?columns=name,messages_ready,messages_unacknowledged,messages",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "columns", "value": "name,messages_ready,messages_unacknowledged,messages" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Cola gps.detection (rafaga R8)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const q = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log(`gps.detection -> listos=${q.messages_ready} sin_ack=${q.messages_unacknowledged}`);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F/gps.detection",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "gps.detection"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "DLQ gps.detection.dlq (parqueados)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const q = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log(`gps.detection.dlq -> parqueados=${q.messages_ready}`);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F/gps.detection.dlq",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "gps.detection.dlq"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Cola trip.creation (F12)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F/trip.creation",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "trip.creation"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Cola notifications.email (F19)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F/notifications.email",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "notifications.email"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspeccionar mensajes parqueados en una DLQ",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log(`Mensajes inspeccionados: ${body.length}`);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"ackmode\": \"ack_requeue_true\",\n  \"encoding\": \"auto\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}/api/queues/%2F/gps.detection.dlq/get",
          "host": ["{{rabbitmq_mgmt_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "queues", "%2F", "gps.detection.dlq", "get"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Metricas y health de aplicacion (R4)",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Metrics - api-gateway",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_gateway_url}}/metrics",
              "host": ["{{api_gateway_url}}"],
              "path": ["metrics"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics - reservation-service",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{reservations_url}}/metrics",
              "host": ["{{reservations_url}}"],
              "path": ["metrics"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Metrics - transportation-service",
          "request": {
